            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lax+transformations"} lax transformations
            and their
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modifications"}> modifications
            \.
          %p
            Spelling this out &amp;lbrack;
            %a{:href => "#Maranda66"}> Maranda 1966
            ,
            = succeed "," do
